# Keep a single fresh executable

After any code or resource change in this repo:

1. Delete leftover binaries in the project root (`*.exe`, `*.exe.new`).
2. Rebuild only `user-data-archiver.exe` with `build.bat`.
3. Confirm the folder contains that one exe and no older copies.

Do not leave extra or stale executables for the user to run by mistake.
